    <div class="head"><p class="kick">Real talk</p><h2>Girl, we&#39;ve heard every excuse.</h2><p class="hsub">We&#39;ve used most of them too. No lectures, no guilt trips. Here&#39;s the honest answer to each.</p></div><div class="exl"><div class="ex"><p class="ext"><span>I always forget.<svg class="sk" viewBox="0 0 300 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 15 C 60 6, 120 20, 180 11 S 270 8, 297 13"/></svg></span></p><div class="exa"><b>Real talk</b><p>Babe, same. That&#39;s why it&#39;s two gummies by the kettle. Done before the toast pops.</p></div></div><div class="ex"><p class="ext"><span>I hate swallowing pills.<svg class="sk" viewBox="0 0 300 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 15 C 60 6, 120 20, 180 11 S 270 8, 297 13"/></svg></span></p><div class="exa"><b>Real talk</b><p>Who doesn&#39;t? It&#39;s a berry gummy. Chew, done. No glass of water, no washing up.</p></div></div><div class="ex"><p class="ext"><span>I&#39;m never home.<svg class="sk" viewBox="0 0 300 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 15 C 60 6, 120 20, 180 11 S 270 8, 297 13"/></svg></span></p><div class="exa"><b>Real talk</b><p>Tell us something new. Small jar. Bag, desk, gym, holiday. It goes where you go.</p></div></div><div class="ex"><p class="ext"><span>Supplements taste like chalk.<svg class="sk" viewBox="0 0 300 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 15 C 60 6, 120 20, 180 11 S 270 8, 297 13"/></svg></span></p><div class="exa"><b>Real talk</b><p>Not on our watch. A berry gummy you&#39;ll actually look forward to.</p></div></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="inside" id="inside"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><div><p class="kick">What&#39;s inside</p><h2 style="margin-top:10px">What&#39;s in the jar.</h2></div><p>No secrets. Here&#39;s exactly what goes into {{ brand }}, and why.</p></div>
    <div class="ingrid"><div class="photo">{%- if section.settings.macro_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.macro_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.macro_image.alt, loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}</div><div class="icards cast"><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The main character</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M8.5 15V9l3.5 4 3.5-4v6"/></svg></i><h3>Magnesium citrate</h3><p>90mg in every gummy. 180mg in your two a day.</p></div><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The crowd-pleaser</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="2.2"/><circle cx="14" cy="12" r="2.2"/><circle cx="11.5" cy="16" r="2.2"/><path d="M11.5 9.5c0-2 1-3.5 3-4.5"/></svg></i><h3>Ripe red berry</h3><p>Soft and chewy. Never chalky, never medicinal.</p></div><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The vegan one</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 19c8 0 14-6 14-14-8 0-14 5-14 12 0 1 0 1.5 0 2z"/><path d="M5 19c3-5 6-8 10-10"/></svg></i><h3>Plant pectin</h3><p>Set with plant pectin, not gelatine. Vegan, babe.</p></div><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The colourist</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3s6 7 6 11a6 6 0 01-12 0c0-4 6-11 6-11z"/></svg></i><h3>That purple</h3><p>Colours from spirulina and anthocyanins.</p></div><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The well-behaved one</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/></svg></i><h3>Made without allergens</h3><p>Made without the 14 major allergens.</p></div><div class="ic2"><span class="role">The open book</span><i><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01"/></svg></i><h3>Nothing hidden</h3><p>Every ingredient and amount, printed on the jar. Go on, check.</p></div></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="claims" id="inside-claims"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><div><p class="kick">The legal bit (stay with us)</p><h2 style="margin-top:10px">Five claims. <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--berry,#8e2a5a)">No bluffing.</em></h2></div><p>These are the UK-authorised claims for magnesium, copied word for word. Babe, if we can&#39;t prove it, we won&#39;t say it.</p></div>
    <div class="cgrid stamped"><div><span class="no">No. 1</span><p>Magnesium contributes to <strong>the reduction of tiredness and fatigue</strong>.</p><svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="stp0" d="M60,60 m-43,0 a43,43 0 1,1 86,0 a43,43 0 1,1 -86,0"/></defs><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="55" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text><textPath href="#stp0">UK APPROVED · WORD FOR WORD · </textPath></text><text x="60" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="ok">OK</text></svg></div><div><span class="no">No. 2</span><p>Magnesium contributes to <strong>normal psychological function</strong>.</p><svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="stp1" d="M60,60 m-43,0 a43,43 0 1,1 86,0 a43,43 0 1,1 -86,0"/></defs><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="55" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text><textPath href="#stp1">UK APPROVED · WORD FOR WORD · </textPath></text><text x="60" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="ok">OK</text></svg></div><div><span class="no">No. 3</span><p>Magnesium contributes to <strong>the normal functioning of the nervous system</strong>.</p><svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="stp2" d="M60,60 m-43,0 a43,43 0 1,1 86,0 a43,43 0 1,1 -86,0"/></defs><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="55" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text><textPath href="#stp2">UK APPROVED · WORD FOR WORD · </textPath></text><text x="60" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="ok">OK</text></svg></div><div><span class="no">No. 4</span><p>Magnesium contributes to <strong>normal muscle function</strong>.</p><svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="stp3" d="M60,60 m-43,0 a43,43 0 1,1 86,0 a43,43 0 1,1 -86,0"/></defs><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="55" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text><textPath href="#stp3">UK APPROVED · WORD FOR WORD · </textPath></text><text x="60" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="ok">OK</text></svg></div><div><span class="no">No. 5</span><p>Magnesium contributes to <strong>the maintenance of normal bones</strong>.</p><svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="stp4" d="M60,60 m-43,0 a43,43 0 1,1 86,0 a43,43 0 1,1 -86,0"/></defs><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="55" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="33" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><text><textPath href="#stp4">UK APPROVED · WORD FOR WORD · </textPath></text><text x="60" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="ok">OK</text></svg></div></div>
