    <div>
      <details class="bfonly"><summary>What does first-batch shipping priority mean?</summary><p>Everyone who reserves is a Founding 500 member. If you reserve between 27 and 30 November, your order is packed and shipped in the first batch when M&euml;va launches in December &mdash; earliest reservations first. Reserving is free and there&#39;s nothing to pay today.</p></details>
