      <details><summary>How many gummies do I take?</summary><p>{{ section.settings.dose_text }} Do not exceed the recommended daily intake.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When should I take them?</summary><p>Any time that suits you. Most women keep the jar by the kettle and take two with breakfast, so it sticks.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What do they taste like?</summary><p>Ripe red berry. Soft, chewy and glossy, never chalky. Honestly, you&#39;ll look forward to it.</p></details>
