      <details><summary>Are they vegan?</summary><p>Yes. They&#39;re set with plant pectin instead of gelatine, and made without the 14 major allergens.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Why magnesium citrate?</summary><p>It&#39;s one of the most widely used forms of magnesium. Two gummies give you 180mg, which is 48% of the Nutrient Reference Value.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long until I notice a difference?</summary><p>Real talk: everyone&#39;s different, so we won&#39;t promise results. Give it a full jar ({{ n }} days) as part of your daily routine. If it isn&#39;t for you, email us within {{ section.settings.guarantee_days }} days of your first order arriving. You don&#39;t need to finish the jar first.</p></details>
