      <details><summary>Can I take it if I&#39;m pregnant or breastfeeding?</summary><p>It&#39;s not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding unless a healthcare professional advises it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How is it made?</summary><p>Made in Spain under Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) by an approved manufacturing partner, then packed and shipped from the UK. Every jar is batch-coded and carries a best-before date.</p></details>
